    "detailed_description": "Journey through distant lands, collect cards to defeat your enemies, and discover other powerful treasures along the way in Card Fencer, a deck building turn-based RPG. Become the master of cards while travelling through lush forests, scorching deserts, and haunting graveyards. Be brave, stay vigilant, and conquer every challenge that stands in your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Adventurous</strong></h2>Brave the wilderness across distinct landscapes. Solve puzzles and defeat dangerous foes to get ahead. Be curious. Who knows what secrets you might uncover?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remain Prepared</strong></h2>Collect cards as you explore the world. Build your deck with precision. Mix and match cards together to merge them into powerful techniques that can change the course of battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessorize</strong></h2>Discover and equip stickers throughout your journey. These unassuming artifacts hold powerful abilities within that are sure to be of great assistance on your travels.",
